1. Wake up the sensor
Registers: PWR_MGT_1
Set SLEEP to 0 to wake up the sensor

2. Read Accelerometer Data
Registers: ACCEL_XOUT_H, ACCEL_XOUT_L, ACCEL_YOUT_H, ACCEL_YOUT_L, ACCEL_ZOUT_H, and ACCEL_ZOUT_L

3. Read Gyroscpoe Data
Registers: GYRO_XOUT_H, GYRO_XOUT_L, GYRO_YOUT_H, GYRO_YOUT_L, GYRO_ZOUT_H, and GYRO_ZOUT_L

